#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div:5-7
msgid "Share the web!"
msgstr "Bagikan situs web!"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:6-7
msgid ""
"Ceno is a free mobile browser that enables you to access and share web "
"information, even when your internet access has been interrupted or cut off. "
"With the help of other users, Ceno helps you sidestep internet censorship."
msgstr ""
"Ceno adalah browser seluler gratis yang memungkinkan Anda mengakses dan "
"berbagi informasi web, bahkan ketika akses internet Anda terputus atau "
"dihentikan. Dengan bantuan pengguna lain, Ceno membantu Anda menghindari "
"sensor internet."

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div:6-232
msgid "Join 566,565 other users"
msgstr "Bergabunglah dengan 566.565 pengguna lainnya"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.h2:27-7
msgid "Ceno in Media"
msgstr "Ceno di Media"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.section.div.h1:39-9
msgid "Browser with a superpower"
msgstr "Browser dengan kekuatan super"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.section.div.p:40-9
msgid ""
"Ceno is the world's first browser that allows people to access blocked "
"content with the help of other Ceno users."
msgstr ""
"Ceno adalah browser pertama di dunia yang memungkinkan pengguna mengakses "
"konten yang diblokir dengan bantuan pengguna Ceno lainnya."

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.section.div.ul.li:42-11
msgid ""
"Is your internet down or censored? You can still access content with Ceno. "
"<a href=\"/@LANG@/faq.html\">Learn how.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Apakah koneksi internet Anda terputus atau diblokir? Anda tetap dapat "
"mengakses konten dengan Ceno. <a href=\"/@LANG@/faq.html\">Pelajari caranya."
"</a>"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.section.div.ul.li:43-11
msgid "VPNs blocked? You can access the web with Ceno."
msgstr "VPN diblokir? Anda tetap bisa mengakses internet dengan Ceno."

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.section.div.ul.li:44-11
msgid "The more that people use it, the better it gets for everyone!"
msgstr ""
"Semakin banyak orang yang menggunakannya, semakin baik hasilnya untuk semua "
"orang!"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.section.div.div.a.div:47-58
#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "./index.html+main.div.section.div.div.a.div:43-58"
#| msgid "Download Ceno"
msgctxt "./index.html+main.div.section.div.div.a.div:47-58"
msgid "Download Ceno"
msgstr "Unduh Ceno"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.div.section.div.h2:57-11
msgid "Resilient"
msgstr "Tangguh"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.div.section.div.p:58-11
msgid ""
"Websites are shared by a global network of peers, and stored in a "
"distributed cache for availability when traditional networks are blocked or "
"go down."
msgstr ""
"Situs web dibagikan melalui jaringan global peer-to-peer dan disimpan dalam "
"cache terdistribusi untuk memastikan ketersediaan saat jaringan tradisional "
"diblokir atau mengalami gangguan."

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.div.section.div.h2:62-11
msgid "Lower data cost"
msgstr "Biaya data lebih rendah"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.div.section.div.p:63-11
msgid ""
"You pay lower data cost because Ceno Browser routes user traffic through "
"peer-to-peer networks, while still providing you with circumvention "
"capability."
msgstr ""
"Anda membayar biaya data yang lebih rendah karena Ceno Browser mengarahkan "
"lalu lintas pengguna melalui jaringan peer-to-peer, sambil tetap memberikan "
"kemampuan untuk menghindari pembatasan."

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.div.section.div.h2:67-11
msgid "Free and open source"
msgstr "Bebas dan sumber terbuka"

#: index.html%2Bmain.div.div.section.div.p:68-11
msgid ""
"Ceno Browser is powered by an open source library called <a href=\"https://"
"ouinet.work\">Ouinet</a> that enables third party developers to incorporate "
"the Ceno network into their apps for peer-to-peer connectivity."
msgstr ""
"Ceno Browser didukung oleh perpustakaan sumber terbuka bernama <a "
"href=\"https://ouinet.work\">Ouinet</a> yang memungkinkan pengembang pihak "
"ketiga untuk mengintegrasikan jaringan Ceno ke dalam aplikasi mereka untuk "
"konektivitas peer-to-peer."

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.h2:77-7
msgid "Be prepared with Ceno"
msgstr "Siapkan diri Anda dengan Ceno"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:81-11
msgid ""
"Don't wait until the next time the internet is blocked to find a solution. "
"Download Ceno now."
msgstr ""
"Jangan tunggu sampai internet diblokir lagi untuk mencari solusi. Unduh Ceno "
"sekarang."

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:85-11
msgid "Help yourself and others. Keep Ceno installed and use it frequently."
msgstr ""
"Bantu diri sendiri dan orang lain. Tetap instal Ceno dan gunakan secara "
"rutin."

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:89-11
msgid ""
"Share websites you access to help build resilience against internet "
"blockages."
msgstr ""
"Bagikan situs web yang Anda akses untuk membantu membangun ketahanan "
"terhadap pemblokiran internet."

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.a.div:93-51
msgid "Learn how it works"
msgstr "Pelajari cara kerjanya"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div:99-7
msgid ""
"Ceno is designed by <a href=\"https://equalitie.org\">eQualitie</a>, a not-"
"for-profit organization creating free & open source tools to protect freedom "
"of speech, facilitate information exchange, & promote self-expression on the "
"internet."
msgstr ""
"Ceno dirancang oleh <a href=\"https://equalitie.org\">eQualitie</a>, sebuah "
"organisasi nirlaba yang mengembangkan alat-alat bebas dan sumber terbuka "
"untuk melindungi kebebasan berekspresi, memfasilitasi pertukaran informasi, "
"dan mempromosikan ekspresi diri di internet."

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.a.div:101-56
msgid "Get Ceno"
msgstr "Dapatkan Ceno"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.h2:111-7
msgid "What Ceno users say"
msgstr "Apa yang dikatakan pengguna Ceno"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:114-11
msgid ""
"\"Extremely important program. and not only for totalitarian countries, I "
"think people of the free world should also use it more often to create a "
"cache of pages. loads faster than other browsers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Program yang sangat penting. Dan tidak hanya untuk negara-negara "
"totaliter, saya pikir orang-orang di dunia bebas juga sebaiknya lebih sering "
"menggunakannya untuk membuat cache halaman. Memuat lebih cepat daripada "
"browser lain.\""

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div:115-11
msgid "Yuriy Karetin"
msgstr "Yuriy Karetin"

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:121-11
msgid ""
"\"Awesome technology, it's free and works fine in Russia where a lot of "
"sites are blocked. The whole image hosting of huge music platform Bandcamp "
"is blocked here for more than a year now because of a single picture, so "
"great to see album covers there again - and without VPN!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Teknologi yang luar biasa, gratis, dan berfungsi dengan baik di Rusia "
"meskipun banyak situs diblokir. Layanan hosting gambar dari platform musik "
"besar Bandcamp telah diblokir di sini selama lebih dari setahun karena satu "
"gambar, jadi sangat menyenangkan melihat sampul album di sana lagi - dan "
"tanpa VPN!\""

#: index.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div:122-11
msgid "Tim Six"
msgstr "Tim Six"

